{"id": "8317cf03-fe98-4c49-8fbe-180002e12bf8", "slug": "nexusgrid-dashboard", "title": "NexusGrid Dashboard", "description": null, "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"NexusGrid Dashboard\"\ndescription: \"System Vitality\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#22D3EE\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#FBBF24\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#71717A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#71717A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# NexusGrid Dashboard\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 4; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, effect.\n## Overview\nNexusGrid Dashboard is a Neuform Featured template imported as a reusable Aura DESIGN.md system.\n\nSystem Vitality\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: NexusGrid; 92 %.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #22D3EE, secondary #000000, accent #FBBF24, background #000000, surface #71717A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>NexusGrid Dashboard</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-100 font-sans antialiased relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 sm:p-8 selection:bg-cyan-500/30\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #27272a 0%, #18181b 100%);\">\n\n    <!-- Skeuomorphic Grid Background -->\n    <div class=\"pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full opacity-30\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(#000 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, #000 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px; box-shadow: inset 0 0 150px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);\"></div>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-5xl grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-6\">\n\n        <!-- Card 1: Data -->\n        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-800 to-zinc-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden group min-h-[300px]\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 0 1px #09090b;\">\n\n            <!-- Recessed Well -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-4 rounded-full opacity-50 pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 text-center mt-[-2rem]\">\n                <h2 id=\"flicker-text\" class=\"text-8xl sm:text-9xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-zinc-100 mb-2 leading-none transition-opacity duration-75\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(34,211,238,0.8), 0 0 40px rgba(34,211,238,0.4);\">92<span class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl text-cyan-400\">%</span></h2>\n                <p class=\"text-sm font-extralight text-zinc-400 uppercase tracking-widest mt-2\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">System Vitality</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Raised Legend Pills with Looping Light Animations -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-6 left-0 w-full flex justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 px-4 z-10\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700 to-zinc-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 1px #09090b;\">\n                    <div class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                        <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-cyan-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-cyan-400\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 6px #22d3ee, inset 0 1px 1px #fff;\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-zinc-200\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">Sensors</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700 to-zinc-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 1px #09090b;\">\n                    <div class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                        <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.3s;\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-400\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 6px #34d399, inset 0 1px 1px #fff;\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-zinc-200\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">Metrics</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-700 to-zinc-800 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hidden sm:flex\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0 1px #09090b;\">\n                    <div class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2\">\n                        <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-amber-400 opacity-75\" style=\"animation-delay: 0.6s;\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-amber-400\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 6px #fbbf24, inset 0 1px 1px #fff;\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-zinc-200\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">Downlink</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Card 2: Brand -->\n        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-800 to-zinc-900 rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden min-h-[300px]\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 0 1px #09090b;\">\n\n            <!-- Recessed Logo Container with Appearing/Disappearing Squares -->\n            <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-900 to-zinc-950 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6 relative z-10 group cursor-pointer transition-transform hover:scale-105 duration-300\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 0 0 1px #000;\">\n                <svg width=\"64\" height=\"64\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"text-zinc-300\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8));\">\n                    <path d=\"M16 16H32V48H16V16Z\" fill=\"url(#grad1)\" class=\"animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s; animation-delay: 0s;\" />\n                    <path d=\"M32 16H48V32H32V16Z\" fill=\"url(#grad2)\" class=\"animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s; animation-delay: 0.5s;\" />\n                    <path d=\"M48 32H64V48H48V32Z\" fill=\"url(#grad3)\" class=\"animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s; animation-delay: 1s;\" />\n                    <path d=\"M0 48H16V64H0V48Z\" fill=\"url(#grad4)\" class=\"animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s; animation-delay: 1.5s;\" />\n                    <defs>\n                        <linearGradient id=\"grad1\" x1=\"16\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"48\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop stop-color=\"#e4e4e7\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#a1a1aa\"/></linearGradient>\n                        <linearGradient id=\"grad2\" x1=\"32\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"32\" y2=\"32\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop stop-color=\"#34d399\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#059669\"/></linearGradient>\n                        <linearGradient id=\"grad3\" x1=\"48\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"48\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop stop-color=\"#22d3ee\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#0891b2\"/></linearGradient>\n                        <linearGradient id=\"grad4\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"64\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><stop stop-color=\"#fbbf24\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#d97706\"/></linearGradient>\n                    </defs>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h1 class=\"text-2xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-zinc-100 mb-1 relative z-10\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">NexusGrid</h1>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 font-extralight tracking-wide uppercase relative z-10\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">Built for Performance</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Card 3: Feature & Command Palette -->\n        <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-800 to-zinc-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 md:col-span-2 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-10 overflow-hidden relative\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.15), 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 0 1px #09090b;\">\n\n            <!-- Left Content -->\n            <div class=\"flex-1 z-10\">\n                <div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-b from-amber-400 to-amber-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.6), 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 0 1px #000;\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-3xl text-zinc-950\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4));\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-zinc-100 mb-3\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">Monitor, Evaluate, Execute</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-base text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md font-extralight\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">\n                    Gather instantaneous metrics to enhance system throughput. Trigger automated workflows and validate connections from a centralized hub.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Content: Skeuomorphic Command Palette -->\n            <div class=\"w-full md:w-80 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-800 to-zinc-900 rounded-xl z-10 flex flex-col overflow-hidden\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 0 1px #000;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-500 to-cyan-600 p-3 flex items-center justify-between\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); border-bottom: 1px solid #000;\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-950\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:terminal-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span class=\"text-sm font-light tracking-wide\">Command Interface</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-zinc-800 text-xs font-light\">\n                        <kbd class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-100 to-zinc-300\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px #fff, 0 2px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 1px solid #71717a;\">⌘</kbd>\n                        <kbd class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-100 to-zinc-300\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px #fff, 0 2px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 1px solid #71717a;\">K</kbd>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col bg-zinc-900\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                    <!-- Typing Animation Terminal Screen -->\n                    <div class=\"p-3 bg-zinc-950/80 border-b border-zinc-950 font-mono text-xs text-cyan-400 h-10 flex items-center\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                        <span id=\"type-text\"></span><span class=\"animate-pulse\">_</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"p-2 flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                        <button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-lg bg-transparent hover:bg-gradient-to-b hover:from-zinc-700 hover:to-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 hover:text-cyan-400 transition-all group border border-transparent hover:border-zinc-950\" style=\"hover:box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-zinc-500 group-hover:text-cyan-400\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm font-extralight\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">Start Workflow</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-lg bg-transparent hover:bg-gradient-to-b hover:from-zinc-700 hover:to-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-all group border border-transparent hover:border-zinc-950\" style=\"hover:box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:health-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-zinc-500 group-hover:text-emerald-400\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm font-extralight\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">System Check</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-sm opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <button class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-lg bg-transparent hover:bg-gradient-to-b hover:from-zinc-700 hover:to-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 hover:text-amber-400 transition-all group border border-transparent hover:border-zinc-950\" style=\"hover:box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-zinc-500 group-hover:text-amber-400\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-sm font-extralight\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 -1px 1px #000;\">Download Records</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-zinc-500 text-xs font-extralight\">\n                                <kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>D</kbd>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-64 h-64 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen z-0\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Flicker Effect for 92%\n        const flickerEl = document.getElementById('flicker-text');\n        setInterval(() => {\n            if(Math.random() > 0.85) {\n                flickerEl.style.opacity = '0.7';\n                flickerEl.style.textShadow = '0 0 10px rgba(34,211,238,0.5), 0 0 20px rgba(34,211,238,0.2)';\n            } else {\n                flickerEl.style.opacity = '1';\n                flickerEl.style.textShadow = '0 0 20px rgba(34,211,238,0.8), 0 0 40px rgba(34,211,238,0.4)';\n            }\n        }, 120);\n\n        // Terminal Typing Animation\n        const typeEl = document.getElementById('type-text');\n        const textToType = \"> initializing nexus protocols...\";\n        let typeIdx = 0;\n        let isDeleting = false;\n\n        setInterval(() => {\n            if (!isDeleting) {\n                typeEl.innerText = textToType.slice(0, typeIdx++);\n                if (typeIdx > textToType.length + 15) isDeleting = true; // pause at the end\n            } else {\n                typeEl.innerText = textToType.slice(0, typeIdx--);\n                if (typeIdx === 0) isDeleting = false;\n            }\n        }, 80);\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexusgrid-dashboard.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexusgrid-dashboard.jpg", "source_name": "nexusgrid-dashboard-DESIGN.md", "views": 98, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-25T03:42:53.673828+00:00"}